{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And under His feet.</b> The earth, which is the lowest of all, as it says: וְהָאָרֶץ הֲדוֹם רַגְלָי (Isaiah 66:1)." "<b>Like the work of sapphire pavement.</b> A substance devoid of all intelligible forms and prepared to receive them, like white sapphire that is devoid of all colors. And this is the substance of the human rational soul, which is devoid of all knowledge and prepared to receive it through voluntary reflection." "<b>And like the essence of the heavens for purity.</b> And they saw that this substance is separate from human matter and pure of it, just as the essence of the heavens — which is the soul of the sphere — is not intermixed with the matter of the sphere or its body at all, but is pure and clean of it, so that this substance is like the essence of the heavens and its soul in respect of purity and freedom from matter."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:27:06.303916123Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}